    "## 9. Cost-based threshold\n",
    "\n",
    "The threshold is chosen from **out-of-fold predictions on the training set only**, then applied once to the test set.\n",
    "Net benefit = SUCCESS_RATE x VALUE_SAVED x (churners reached) - OFFER_COST x (offers made)."
   ]
